000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SRT1.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT W-FILE ASSIGN TO "sort_in.dat".
000700     SELECT IN-F ASSIGN TO "sort_in.dat".
000800     SELECT SRT ASSIGN TO "sort_tmp.dat".
000900     SELECT G-FILE ASSIGN TO "sort_out.dat".
001000     SELECT R-FILE ASSIGN TO "sort_out.dat".
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 FILE SECTION.
001300 FD W-FILE.
001400 01 W-REC.
001500    05 W-NAME PIC X(5).
001600    05 W-AGE PIC 99.
001700 FD IN-F.
001800 01 IN-REC.
001900    05 I-NAME PIC X(5).
002000    05 I-AGE PIC 99.
002100 SD SRT.
002200 01 SRT-REC.
002300    05 S-NAME PIC X(5).
002400    05 S-AGE PIC 99.
002500 FD G-FILE.
002600 01 G-REC.
002700    05 G-NAME PIC X(5).
002800    05 G-AGE PIC 99.
002900 FD R-FILE.
003000 01 R-REC.
003100    05 R-NAME PIC X(5).
003200    05 R-AGE PIC 99.
003300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003400 01 EOF-FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 0.
003500    88 AT-EOF VALUE 1.
003600 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003700 MAIN.
003800     OPEN OUTPUT W-FILE.
003900     MOVE "BOB" TO W-NAME. MOVE 30 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
004000     MOVE "AL" TO W-NAME. MOVE 25 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
004100     MOVE "CY" TO W-NAME. MOVE 30 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
004200     MOVE "DI" TO W-NAME. MOVE 25 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
004300     CLOSE W-FILE.
004400     SORT SRT ON ASCENDING KEY S-AGE
004500         ON DESCENDING KEY S-NAME
004600         USING IN-F GIVING G-FILE.
004700     OPEN INPUT R-FILE.
004800     PERFORM UNTIL AT-EOF
004900         READ R-FILE
005000             AT END SET AT-EOF TO TRUE
005100             NOT AT END DISPLAY R-NAME " " R-AGE
005200         END-READ
005300     END-PERFORM.
005400     CLOSE R-FILE.
005500     STOP RUN.
